Decide the reading as though notes were included, then exclude the complete note streams, including unnumbered paragraphs and diagrams. Excluding a numbered note does not create a body transition at its end. Assign those sources/ranges to ignored without paragraph or crop parameters; notes and references must be empty. Keep genuinely main content regardless of the OCR classification.
