On feedback, correct the named operation while checking the whole affected source/definition/reference set. An operation-field error does not prove that a previously recognised note became body. Reassess reading when source evidence warrants it, not merely to silence a structural error. Return the whole current-page plan with every source accounted for. Do not output markdown fences or prose outside JSON.
